        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanuka nun inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Itukwi ere lokaokot, amoti nairourounit, airourounike namam alomuni kotomake! Kisujau einer ka einer komam eroet edoikinit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
